  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1801.04 Federal Definitions Incorporated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1801.04 Federal Definitions Incorporated. Terms used in this chapter that are defined in 40 CFR 61.141 shall be as reprinted in Appendix D, except for the following:\n\n(a) Asbestos;\n\n(b) Facility;\n\n(c) RACM; and\n\n(d) Remove.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
